{
  "id": 8867138437319,
  "title": "Christian Bedding Set – Inspirational Bible Verse Comforter",
  "handle": "christian-bedding-set-inspirational-bible-verse-comforter",
  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into a sanctuary of faith with this beautifully designed Christian bedding set, featuring inspiring Bible verses and accents. It's the perfect thoughtful gift for the special women in your life, whether for birthdays, holidays, or simply as a constant reminder of love and faith. This set offers the choice of a lightweight duvet cover or a convenient all-in-one comforter for personalized comfort.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An inspiring Christian bedding set, perfect for women and ideal for birthdays, special occasions, or as a reminder of faith.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type:</strong> Choose between a duvet cover (no filling insert) for a lightweight option or a comforter for all-in-one warmth and convenience.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Each package includes 1 Duvet Cover (or Comforter) and optional Pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Made from 100% brushed polyester fabric, soft, comfy, durable, and lightweight.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Fill Material:</strong> Comforter includes whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping or shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Letter Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Design</th>\n<td>Christian Knight Templar</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Twin, Full, Queen, King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat; recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
